WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.991
(audience clapping)

00:00:00.991 --> 00:00:02.247
- [Kelly] Have y'all met before?

00:00:02.247 --> 00:00:03.080
In anything?

00:00:03.080 --> 00:00:03.913
- [John] Yes, we have.

00:00:03.913 --> 00:00:04.746
- [Kelly] Oh, you have?

00:00:04.746 --> 00:00:05.938
- [Kyra] We did. We did.

00:00:05.938 --> 00:00:06.771
- [Kelly] Okay, awesome, awesome.

00:00:06.771 --> 00:00:07.604
Well I didn't know if
y'all...sometimes people haven't.

00:00:07.604 --> 00:00:08.940
And we like to bring people together.

00:00:08.940 --> 00:00:11.850
Um (chuckling), but we
were talking about music.

00:00:11.850 --> 00:00:13.491
So you play piano, right?

00:00:13.491 --> 00:00:14.324
- I do, yes.

00:00:14.324 --> 00:00:15.300
- [Kelly] Like, since you were
a kid, right? Like, little.

00:00:15.300 --> 00:00:16.620
- Yeah, over 20 years now.

00:00:16.620 --> 00:00:17.453
- [Kelly] Wow.

00:00:17.453 --> 00:00:18.300
- [John] Yeah, I also have to say,

00:00:18.300 --> 00:00:21.270
you guys were so sweet to
me when I met you guys.

00:00:21.270 --> 00:00:22.410
They welcomed me into their home.

00:00:22.410 --> 00:00:24.090
And we did this table reading there.

00:00:24.090 --> 00:00:25.293
- [Kyra] Aw, that's sweet.

00:00:25.293 --> 00:00:26.476
- [Kevin] Yeah. You were
awesome, you were awesome

00:00:26.476 --> 00:00:27.309
- [John] You guys are adorable.

00:00:27.309 --> 00:00:28.142
- [Kelly] Oh, that's so...

00:00:28.142 --> 00:00:28.975
- [Kyra] Yeah, you were. You were great.

00:00:28.975 --> 00:00:29.891
- Aw, you guys are so nice.

00:00:29.891 --> 00:00:31.807
I have to just quickly tell
a story, which is that,

00:00:31.807 --> 00:00:33.690
my dad called me yesterday.

00:00:33.690 --> 00:00:35.490
And I told him I was
coming out with you guys.

00:00:35.490 --> 00:00:39.600
And he insisted that I
attempt to tell some story

00:00:39.600 --> 00:00:41.718
about him auditioning for Footloose?

00:00:41.718 --> 00:00:43.791
(all laughing)

00:00:43.791 --> 00:00:45.480
- [John] He, like...

00:00:45.480 --> 00:00:46.313
- [Kelly] He didn't make the cut?

00:00:46.313 --> 00:00:49.170
- He regaled me with this
like seven-minute story.

00:00:49.170 --> 00:00:50.610
And was like, make sure you tell that.

00:00:50.610 --> 00:00:52.642
I was like, so you want
me to use the entire time.

00:00:52.642 --> 00:00:53.781
(all laughing)

00:00:53.781 --> 00:00:54.614
(Kyra clapping hands)

00:00:54.614 --> 00:00:55.811
- [Kelly] Use my entire segment?

00:00:55.811 --> 00:00:57.442
(Kelly laughing and clapping)

00:00:57.442 --> 00:00:58.300
- [John] Yes.

00:00:58.300 --> 00:00:59.151
- [Kevin] Your only segment.

00:00:59.151 --> 00:01:00.149
- [John] Completely about him.

00:01:00.149 --> 00:01:01.071
- [Kevin] Tell him to
get your own segment.

00:01:01.071 --> 00:01:01.904
(Kelly laughing)

00:01:01.904 --> 00:01:02.737
- [John] And then, at
the very end was like,

00:01:02.737 --> 00:01:03.570
and make sure you say hi.

00:01:03.570 --> 00:01:04.403
(audience chuckling)

00:01:04.403 --> 00:01:05.424
- [John] I was like cool.
That's very fitting.

00:01:05.424 --> 00:01:06.551
- Ah, so John, now you have this show.

00:01:06.551 --> 00:01:08.070
It's called Unstable, which
is the greatest title ever.

00:01:08.070 --> 00:01:09.540
So, it's it's with your father.

00:01:09.540 --> 00:01:12.540
So, what, is it basically
about y'all's relationship?

00:01:12.540 --> 00:01:14.400
- Yeah, it's, it's based
on our relationship.

00:01:14.400 --> 00:01:16.320
We, we don't play exactly ourselves.

00:01:16.320 --> 00:01:18.450
He plays, uh, sort of an eccentric,

00:01:18.450 --> 00:01:21.180
insane biotech engineer entrepreneur.

00:01:21.180 --> 00:01:24.090
Kind of Elon Musk-y vibes.

00:01:24.090 --> 00:01:27.390
Which, uh, you know is ripe
to make fun of, I think.

00:01:27.390 --> 00:01:28.355
- [Kelly] Yeah.

00:01:28.355 --> 00:01:29.188
(audience chuckling)

00:01:29.188 --> 00:01:30.270
- [John] I love the the style of, like,

00:01:30.270 --> 00:01:31.710
comedy of manners, and.

00:01:31.710 --> 00:01:32.754
- [Kelly] Yeah.

00:01:32.754 --> 00:01:33.870
- [John] Poking fun at the social elites.

00:01:33.870 --> 00:01:35.850
And, um, it's very relatable.

00:01:35.850 --> 00:01:38.920
That dynamic of a, a parent
that's very, well, annoying.

00:01:38.920 --> 00:01:39.753
- [Kelly] Yeah. Yeah.

00:01:39.753 --> 00:01:41.581
- [John] Uh, oversteps boundaries.

00:01:41.581 --> 00:01:42.414
- Yeah.

00:01:42.414 --> 00:01:44.460
- But, but, but their intentions are pure

00:01:44.460 --> 00:01:45.330
and they just care.

00:01:45.330 --> 00:01:48.630
And our relationship
happens to be sort of unique

00:01:48.630 --> 00:01:52.350
in that he's in the public eye
and, and, and, and "beloved".

00:01:52.350 --> 00:01:53.454
- [Kelly] Yeah.

00:01:53.454 --> 00:01:55.140
- And so there's not that
many people that agree

00:01:55.140 --> 00:01:57.120
with me when I say like, no,
but you don't understand.

00:01:57.120 --> 00:01:59.700
He's, he, you can be wildly annoying.

00:01:59.700 --> 00:02:00.533
- [Kelly] Yeah.

00:02:00.533 --> 00:02:01.366
- So, when you don't have many people.

00:02:01.366 --> 00:02:02.340
- [Kelly] Every parent can, yeah.

00:02:02.340 --> 00:02:04.050
- I got a quick pitch for a storyline.

00:02:04.050 --> 00:02:06.990
You find out that your dad,
who's the Elon Musk type.

00:02:06.990 --> 00:02:07.823
- [John] Yeah.

00:02:07.823 --> 00:02:11.074
- Actually, unbeknownst to
you, auditioned for Footloose.

00:02:11.074 --> 00:02:11.907
(all laughing)

00:02:11.907 --> 00:02:13.260
(Kelly clapping)

00:02:13.260 --> 00:02:14.093
- If you, okay.

00:02:14.093 --> 00:02:16.350
- And you get to point out the
fact that he didn't get it.

00:02:16.350 --> 00:02:17.545
- He didn't get it.

00:02:17.545 --> 00:02:18.378
(laughing)

00:02:18.378 --> 00:02:19.211
He claims it's 'cause he, like,

00:02:19.211 --> 00:02:20.887
blew his knee out in the audition.

00:02:20.887 --> 00:02:21.720
(laughing)

00:02:21.720 --> 00:02:23.386
Which is like the most Rob thing ever.

00:02:23.386 --> 00:02:25.476
- [Kelly] He was going to be amazing.

00:02:25.476 --> 00:02:26.820
- He'd be like, I was
crushing it until the minute.

00:02:26.820 --> 00:02:29.037
I'm just picturing like he was
seeing people not enjoying it

00:02:29.037 --> 00:02:30.774
and he was like, my knee!

00:02:30.774 --> 00:02:32.520
(all laughing)

00:02:32.520 --> 00:02:34.065
- [John] He is like, get the stretcher.

00:02:34.065 --> 00:02:35.225
(Kevin laughing and clapping)

00:02:35.225 --> 00:02:36.750
- [Kelly] Oh God.

00:02:36.750 --> 00:02:38.931
Your level of wit is incredible, man.

00:02:38.931 --> 00:02:39.852
- Thank you.

00:02:39.852 --> 00:02:40.685
- [Kevin] That is so funny.

00:02:40.685 --> 00:02:41.673
- [Kelly] Oh my God. I love you.

